OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged under National
OL,4,ASecurity Act after RAF Fairford
OL,5,Aincident
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 24-year-old man has been charged with
OL,8,Fassisting a foreign intelligence
OL,9,Fservice over last month's incident near
OL,10,FRAF Fairford.
OL,12,FMohmed Abdulkarim and another man,
OL,13,FNouman Essghir, 24, who has been
OL,14,Fcharged with entering a prohibited
OL,15,Fplace for a purpose prejudicial to the
OL,16,FUK, will appear at Westminster
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
