OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged under National
OL,4,ASecurity Act after RAF Fairford
OL,5,Aincident
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother man, a 25-year-old UK-Iranian
OL,8,Fnational, who was re-arrested last
OL,9,Fweek, has been released without charge
OL,10,Fbut remains on police bail following
OL,11,Fhis first arrest earlier this month,
OL,12,FCounter Terrorism Policing has said.
OL,14,FCTP believe the foreign intelligence
OL,15,Fservice involved in the case is Iran.
